 and certificates</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-surface-low text-content-high hover:bg-b2m-surface-hover px-4 py-3 text-high-s gap-2 min-h-spacing-b2m-12 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer min-h-[44px] w-full sm:w-auto" href="#table" aria-label="See comparative table — How do we protect you? Learn about the security that only Bit2Me brings you" title="See comparative table — How do we protect you? Learn about the security that only Bit2Me brings you">See comparative table</a></div></div></div><div class="relative w-full flex-1"><a href="https://security.bit2me.com/" aria-label="Partners and certificates — How do we protect you? Learn about the security that only Bit2Me brings you" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] block"><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[550px]"><img alt="Bit2Me Security" width="550" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fhero%2Fcover-security%402x.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fhero%2Fcover-security%402x.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fhero%2Fcover-security%402x.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85"/></div></a></div></div><div class="mt-8"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center lg:hidden"><div><p class="typo-title text-content-high">Operational since 2014</p><p class="typo-body-s text-content-mid max-w-xs mx-auto max-w-md">First Spanish Fintech to obtain the MiCA License</p></div><a class="no-underline text-inherit hover:no-underline" aria-label="Legal compliance certifications, Security Certifications, The best crypto exchange" href="/security