cale-0 hover:opacity-100" style="color:transparent;width:auto;height:64px" src="/assets/img/common/iso-27701/iso-27701-grey.svg"/></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 lg:items-start"><span class="typo-caption text-content-mid">Security Certifications</span><ul role="list" class="flex -translate-y-2 gap-0 items-center flex-wrap justify-center lg:justify-start list-none p-0 m-0"><li class="flex items-center justify-center"><img alt="ISO 22301" loading="lazy" width="90" height="90" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto object-contain opacity-85 grayscale transition-all hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 block" style="color:transparent;width:90px;height:90px" src="/assets/img/certifications/iso-22301-bw.png"/></li><li class="flex items-center justify-center"><img alt="ISO 27001" loading="lazy" width="90" height="90" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto object-contain opacity-85 grayscale transition-all hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 block" style="color:transparent;width:90px;height:90px" src="/assets/img/certifications/iso-27001-bw.png"/></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 lg:items-start"><span class="typo-caption text-content-mid">The best crypto exchange</span><ul role="list" class="flex items-center gap-3 list-none p-0 m-0"><li><img alt="The Good Exchange" loading="lazy" width="140" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain opacity-90 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity" style="color:transparent;width:auto;height:64px" src="/assets/img/common/good-exchange/the-good-exchange-grey.svg"/></li></ul></div></a></div></div></div></section><div id="partners"><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center mb-16"><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-b2m-m w-full h-auto" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fregister%2Fsecurity%2Fbanner%2Fcointelegraph.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fregister%2Fsecurity%2Fbanner%2Fcointelegraph.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fregister%2Fsecurity%2Fbanner%2Fcointelegraph.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85"/></div><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><h2 class="text-content-high typo-h2 mb-6">One of the most reliable exchanges</h2><p class="text-content-mid typo-body mb-8">Bit2Me stood out as one of the most reliable exchanges in a Cointelegraph Research report where it compared the most important exchanges in the world (<a class="text-content-primary underline" href="#table">see table</a>). The analysis evaluated 4 criteria: Fiscal headquarters, transparency, asset protection, and user experience.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-surface-low text-content-high hover:bg-b2m-surface-hover px-3 h-9 text-high-xs gap-1 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer" href="/assets/downloads/reports/cointelegraph-standards.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Download report — One of the most reliable exchanges">Download report<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.75 2.75a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0v8.614L6.295 8.235a.75.75 0 10-1.09 1.03l4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 001.09 0l4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 00-1.09-1.03l-2.955 3.129V2.75z"></path><path d="M3.5 12.75a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0v2.5A2.75 2.75 0 004.75 18h10.5A2.75 2.75 0 0018 15.25v-2.5a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0v2.5c0 .69-.56 1.25-1.25 1.25H4.75c-.69 0-1.25-.56-1.25-1.25v-2.5z"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center gap-6 lg:gap-8"><p class="typo-title-s shrink-0 lg:max-w-[9rem]">Our partners</p><div class="w-full min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center flex-nowrap justify-between gap-3 sm:gap-4 lg:gap-5 overflow-x-auto pb-1"><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Mastercard" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/trust/logos/trusted-by-mastercard@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Ledger" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/trust/logos/trusted-by-ledger@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Telefónica" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/trust/logos/trusted-by-telefonica@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Jumio" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/trust/logos/trusted-by-jumio@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Pecunpay" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/trust/logos/trusted-by-pecunpay@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Iberian Lawyer" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/trust/logos/trusted-by-iberian-lawyer@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Expansión" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/trust/logos/trusted-by-expansion@2x.webp"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="text-center mb-12"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Cryptocurrency management</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high typo-h2">About security at Bit2Me</h2></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="bg-surface-low rounded-b2m-m p-6 border-l-4 border-border-mid"><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title-s mb-3">Cold storage</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">A large part of our users&#x27; crypto funds are always stored in cold storage with HSM technology and under multi-signature to ensure top-level protection.</p></div><div class="bg-surface-low rounded-b2m-m p-6 border-l-4 border-border-mid"><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title-s mb-3">Data security beyond GDPR</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">The stored data is encrypted and stored in scattered chunks. We take data privacy very seriously and can guarantee full compliance with GDPR regulations.</p></div></div><div class="max-w-xl mx-auto mt-6"><div class="bg-surface-low rounded-b2m-m p-6 border-l-4 border-border-mid"><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title-s mb-3">Legal and regulatory compliance</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">At Bit2Me, we comply with all applicable laws, including corporate, tax, labor, accounting, commercial... This eliminates the risk of potential problems that could indirectly affect the customer.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center"><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><h2 class="text-content-high typo-h2 mb-4">Insured funds up to 150 million dollars with Ledger</h2><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s mb-6">We have 150 million in insurance funds with Ledger</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-surface-low text-content-high hover:bg-b2m-surface-hover px-3 h-9 text-high-xs gap-1 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer" href="/assets/downloads/ledger/ledger-insurance.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="See more about the funds secured with Ledger">See more</a></div><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><img alt="Ledger Enterprise + Arch Lloyd&#x27;s" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-b2m-m w-full h-auto" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fabout%2Fledger-arch-lloyds.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fabout%2Fledger-arch-lloyds.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fabout%2Fledger-arch-lloyds.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85"/></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-surface-low py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center"><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><img alt="João Augusto, Compliance Officer at Bit2Me" loading="lazy" width="550" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-b2m-m w-full h-auto object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcompliance%2Fjoao-augusto.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcompliance%2Fjoao-augusto.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcompliance%2Fjoao-augusto.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85"/></div><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><p class="typo-caption text-content-mid mb-2">Compliance</p><blockquote class="mb-8"><h2 class="typo-h2 text-content-high mb-2">“<!-- -->At Bit2Me, we take compliance with regulations very seriously to protect the user<!-- -->”</h2><footer class="text-content-mid typo-caption">João Augusto</footer></blockquote><ul class="space-y-4"><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-b2m-primary rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><span class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">GDPR</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-b2m-primary rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><span class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">DORA</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-b2m-primary rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><span class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">CSA Star</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-b2m-primary rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><span class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">ISO 27001</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="text-center mb-12"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Certifications</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high typo-h2">First company in the world to obtain this triple compliance certification</h2></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12"><div class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low p-6 rounded-b2m-m text-center"><div class="flex justify-center mb-6"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="180" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-40 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/certifications/une-19601-grey.svg"/></div><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title mb-3">Certification EQA UNE 19601</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">It sets out the requirements for the implementation and management of criminal compliance systems, helping to prevent crime and reduce risk in organisations.</p></div><div class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low p-6 rounded-b2m-m text-center"><div class="flex justify-center mb-6"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="180" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-40 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/certifications/iso-37301-grey.svg"/></div><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title mb-3">Certification ISO 37301</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">Provides guidelines for implementing, developing, maintaining and improving a compliance management system. Helps to comply with laws by promoting a culture of integrity and ethical behaviour.</p></div><div class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low p-6 rounded-b2m-m text-center"><div class="flex justify-center mb-6"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="180" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-40 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/certifications/iso-37001-grey.svg"/></div><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title mb-3">Certification ISO 37001</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">Sets out requirements and provides guidance for the implementation, maintenance and improvement of an anti-bribery management system. Promotes a culture of integrity, transparency and compliance.</p></div><div class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low p-6 rounded-b2m-m text-center"><div class="flex justify-center mb-6"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="180" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-40 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/certifications/iso-27701-grey.svg"/></div><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title mb-3">Certification ISO 27701</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">A System of Information Privacy Management has been implemented. This demonstrates a commitment to the protection of personal data and compliance, strengthening the trust of customers and collaborators.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12"><div class="text-center"><div class="flex justify-center mb-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-24 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcertifications%2Fcheck%402x.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcertifications%2Fcheck%402x.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcertifications%2Fcheck%402x.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=85"/></div><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title mb-2">CNMV</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">MiCA license for Execution, RTO, Custody, Exchange, Transfer, and Placement services.</p></div><div class="text-center"><div class="flex justify-center mb-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-28 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fcertifications%2Fiso-27001-color.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fcertifications%2Fiso-27001-color.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fcertifications%2Fiso-27001-color.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=85"/></div><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title mb-2">Certification ISO 27001</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">Endorses the information security management system for the purchase, sale, and custody of crypto assets.</p></div><div class="text-center"><div class="flex justify-center mb-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-28 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fcertifications%2Fiso-22301-color.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fcertifications%2Fiso-22301-color.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fcertifications%2Fiso-22301-color.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=85"/></div><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title mb-2">Certification ISO 22301</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">Endorses the information security management system for the purchase, sale, and custody of crypto assets.</p></div><div class="text-center"><div class="flex justify-center mb-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-24 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcertifications%2Fcertificate-star-level-one%402x.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcertifications%2Fcertificate-star-level-one%402x.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcertifications%2Fcertificate-star-level-one%402x.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=85"/></div><h3 class="text-content-high typo-title mb-2">CSA Star</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">Ensures protection in cloud environments, covering transparency, audits, and compliance with regulations.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="text-center mb-12"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Robust Platform</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high typo-h2">360º Security</h2></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6"><div class="b2m-component component-banner group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-m bg-surface-low min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[340px]"><div class="relative z-10 p-8 md:py-12 sm:max-w-[65%]"><h3 class="mb-2 typo-h2 text-content-high">Outside of tax havens</h3><p class="typo-title mb-2 text-content-high">Our headquarters are in Europe, with the stability that this entails</p><p class="typo-body mb-6 text-content-mid">The European legal framework stands out for being the first major territory to create agreed-upon rules around digital assets thanks to the MiCA law. This positions us as offering good guarantees compared to the legal uncertainty of other blockchain companies located in other territories.</p></div><div class="hidden sm:block absolute z-0 pointer-events-none bottom-0 w-[55%] aspect-square right-0"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/security-360/european-company@2x.webp"/></div><div class="sm:hidden relative h-64 w-full pointer-events-none shrink-0 overflow-hidden"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/security-360/european-company@2x.webp"/></div></div><div class="b2m-component component-banner group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-m bg-surface-low min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[340px]"><div class="relative z-10 p-8 md:py-12 sm:max-w-[65%]"><h3 class="mb-2 typo-h2 text-content-high">Zero thefts in our history</h3><p class="typo-title mb-2 text-content-high">Operating safely since 2014</p><p class="typo-body mb-6 text-content-mid">Unlike the vast majority of platforms in the industry, we have never suffered any theft of funds since the creation of the platform.</p></div><div class="hidden sm:block absolute z-0 pointer-events-none bottom-0 w-[55%] aspect-square right-0"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/security-360/no-theft@2x.webp"/></div><div class="sm:hidden relative h-64 w-full pointer-events-none shrink-0 overflow-hidden"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/security-360/no-theft@2x.webp"/></div></div><div class="b2m-component component-banner group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-m bg-surface-low min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[340px]"><div class="relative z-10 p-8 md:py-12 sm:max-w-[65%]"><h3 class="mb-2 typo-h2 text-content-high">Audited by independent third parties</h3><p class="typo-title mb-2 text-content-high">5 consecutive audits with positive results</p><p class="typo-body mb-6 text-content-mid">We are the first private exchange in the world to have 5 consecutive financial audits with positive results carried out by independent third parties</p></div><div class="hidden sm:block absolute z-0 pointer-events-none bottom-0 w-[55%] aspect-square right-0"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/security-360/third-party-audits@2x.webp"/></div><div class="sm:hidden relative h-64 w-full pointer-events-none shrink-0 overflow-hidden"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/security-360/third-party-audits@2x.webp"/></div></div><div class="b2m-component component-banner group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-m bg-surface-low min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[340px]"><div class="relative z-10 p-8 md:py-12 sm:max-w-[65%]"><h3 class="mb-2 typo-h2 text-content-high">Awarded as the best SME in regulatory and legal compliance 2022</h3><p class="typo-title mb-2 text-content-high">Compliance Award</p><p class="typo-body mb-6 text-content-mid">Throughout our history, we have received great recognitions, highlighting the award for the Best SME in regulatory and legal compliance of the year 2022, alongside BBVA and Prosegur.</p><span data-theme="light" class="contents"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-transparent text-content-primary hover:bg-surface-action-low hover:text-b2m-primary-hover px-4 py-3 text-high-s gap-2 min-h-spacing-b2m-12 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer" href="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/premio-pyme-compliance-premios-expansion/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Read news: Awarded as the best SME in regulatory and legal compliance 2022">Read news<span class="inline-flex items-center leading-none interactive-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><i class="b2m-icon-arrow-right b2m-icon-glyph icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></a></span></div><div class="hidden sm:block absolute z-0 pointer-events-none bottom-0 w-[55%] aspect-square right-0"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/security-360/awarded-as-best-pyme-compliance-2022@2x.webp"/></div><div class="sm:hidden relative h-64 w-full pointer-events-none shrink-0 overflow-hidden"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/security-360/awarded-as-best-pyme-compliance-2022@2x.webp"/></div></div></div><div class="b2m-component component-banner group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-m bg-surface-low min-h-[360px]"><div class="flex flex-col flex-1 md:flex-row-reverse"><div class="flex-1"><div class="relative z-10 p-8 md:py-12 flex flex-col justify-center items-start"><h3 class="mb-2 typo-h2 text-content-high">Iberian Lawyer Gold Award for its work in Compliance 2023</h3><p class="typo-title mb-2 text-content-high">Compliance Award</p><p class="typo-body mb-6 text-content-mid">Bit2Me was awarded the Iberian Lawyer prize for its Compliance work, in a category where it competed with representatives from large companies such as VISA, HP, Nokia, or Meliá Hotels, and where the most important banks of Spain were also present.</p><span data-theme="light" class="contents"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-transparent text-content-primary hover:bg-surface-action-low hover:text-b2m-primary-hover px-4 py-3 text-high-s gap-2 min-h-spacing-b2m-12 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer" href="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/premio-de-oro-de-iberian-lawyer-compliance/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Read news: Iberian Lawyer Gold Award for its work in Compliance 2023">Read news<span class="inline-flex items-center leading-none interactive-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><i class="b2m-icon-arrow-right b2m-icon-glyph icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></a></span></div></div><div class="relative min-h-[300px] md:flex-1 overflow-hidden"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/security-360/prize-compliance-iberian-lawyer-2023.jpg"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14" id="table"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="text-center mb-12"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Download the comparative report based on 40 indicators</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high typo-h2">Cointelegraph rates us as one of the most reliable companies</h2><p class="typo-body max-w-2xl text-content-mid mx-auto">Report issued by Cointelegraph in 2024</p></div><div class="mb-8"><div class="w-full"><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-b2m-l border border-surface-mid bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-m" role="region" aria-label="Cointelegraph comparison of crypto platforms (The New Crypto Exchange Standards)" tabindex="0"><table class="w-full min-w-[720px] table-fixed border-separate border-spacing-0 text-left"><caption class="sr-only">Cointelegraph comparison of crypto platforms (The New Crypto Exchange Standards)</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="sticky left-0 z-10 border-b border-surface-mid bg-surface-raised px-4 py-4 typo-caption uppercase tracking-wide text-content-low">Criterion</th><th scope="col" class="border-b border-surface-mid px-3 py-4 text-center typo-title-s bg-surface-low text-content-high">Binance</th><th scope="col" class="border-b border-surface-mid px-3 py-4 text-center typo-title-s bg-surface-primary text-content-onprimary">Bit2Me</th><th scope="col" class="border-b border-surface-mid px-3 py-4 text-center typo-title-s bg-surface-low text-content-high">Coinbase</th><th scope="col" class="border-b border-surface-mid px-3 py-4 text-center typo-title-s bg-surface-low text-content-high">Kraken</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="colgroup" colSpan="5" class="border-t border-surface-mid bg-surface-action-low px-4 py-3 text-left typo-caption font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-content-mid">Legal protections for customers</th></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="sticky left-0 z-10 border-t border-surface-mid/80 px-4 py-3 text-left typo-body-s font-semibold text-content-high bg-surface-raised">Headquarters jurisdiction</th><td class="border-t border-surface-mid/80 px-3 py-3 text-center typo-body-s text-content-mid bg-surface-raised">Cayman Islands</td><td class="border-t border-surface-mid/80 px-3 py-3 text-center typo-body-s bg-surface-action-low font-semibold text-content-high">Spain</td><td class="border-t border-surface-mid/80 px-3 py-3 text-center typo-body-s text-content-mid bg-surface-raised">United States</td><td class="border-t border-surface-mid/80 px-3