ext-center typo-body-s text-content-mid bg-surface-low/40">3</td><td class="border-t border-surface-mid/80 px-3 py-3 text-center typo-body-s text-content-mid bg-surface-low/40">7</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="mt-4 text-center typo-caption text-content-mid">Source: Cointelegraph report “The New Crypto Exchange Standards”.</p></div></div><div class="text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-b2m-primary text-white hover:bg-b2m-primary-hover shadow-b2m-m px-4 py-3 text-high-s gap-2 min-h-spacing-b2m-12 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer" href="/assets/downloads/reports/cointelegraph-standards.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download Full Report<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.75 2.75a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0v8.614L6.295 8.235a.75.75 0 10-1.09 1.03l4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 001.09 0l4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 00-1.09-1.03l-2.955 3.129V2.75z"></path><path d="M3.5 12.75a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0v2.5A2.75 2.75 0 004.75 18h10.5A2.75 2.75 0 0018 15.25v-2.5a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0v2.5c0 .69-.56 1.25-1.25 1.25H4.75c-.69 0-1.25-.56-1.25-1.25v-2.5z"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-14 md:py-16"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="text-center mb-8 md:mb-10"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Why Bit2Me?</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high typo-h2">Sleep peacefully with Bit2Me</h2></div><div class="grid gap-5 md:gap-6 grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4"><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-clock b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">10 years operating with cryptocurrencies</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">Providing security, guarantee, and support to crypto operations</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-bank b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Regulated in the European Union</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">First crypto exchange with registration at the Bank of Spain</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-support b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Quality support in your language</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">We help you, with support across multiple channels and in your language</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-tax b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Free tax report included</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">Your tax return reports in one click</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-shield-check b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Highly recognised certifications</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">Regulated under the MICA licence, and ISO 27001, ISO 37001, ISO 22301 among others</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-check-circle b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Internal and external audits</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">Bit2Me undergoes multiple annual security and legal audits, among others</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-academy b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Free education included</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">Educational content available to make informed decisions</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-briefcase b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Backed by Telefónica and Investcorp</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">Bit2Me partners with listed companies</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="bg-b2m-primary rounded-b2m-m overflow-hidden flex flex-col lg:flex-row"><div class="lg:w-1/2 p-8 lg:p-12 flex flex-col justify-center"><h2 class="typo-h2 text-white mb-2">Bug Bounty</h2><p class="typo-h3 text-white/90 mb-4">Cybersecurity</p><p class="typo-body text-white/80 mb-6">Hundreds of top-level IT specialists collaborate in the continuous improvement of Bit2Me&#x27;s security. At Bit2Me, hacker culture is and has always been part of our DNA.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-white text-content-primary shadow-b2m-m hover-emphasis-surface hover:bg-b2m-surface-hover px-3 h-9 text-high-xs gap-1 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer" href="https://support.bit2me.com/en/support/solutions/articles/35000170366" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Access the Bug Bounty<span class="inline-flex items-center leading-none interactive-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><i class="b2m-icon-arrow-right b2m-icon-glyph icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></a></div><div class="lg:w-1/2"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fbug-bounty%2Fbug-bounty%402x.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fbug-bounty%2Fbug-bounty%402x.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fbug-bounty%2Fbug-bounty%402x.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85"/></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="text-left mb-12"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Our system</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high typo-h2">Multi-layer Model</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 "><div class="flex flex-row gap-6"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px]">01</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">Safe work area and anti-corruption policies</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">We protect and train all employees, with the highest security measures in software and hardware and strict anti-corruption policies.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-6"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px]">02</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">Development in secure environments</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">All developments are carried out in a testing environment, undergoing quality and stability tests, and cybersecurity review protocols.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-6"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px]">03</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">Reinforced infrastructure</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">We have the latest standards to protect our infrastructure: WAF, isolated service execution, SIEM, internal and external SOC, IDS monitoring, etc.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-6"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px]">04</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">Secure management of cryptocurrencies</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">Cold storage with Ledger, protection insurance, automatic and integrity analysis, advanced MPC, distributed multi-signature, etc.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-6"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px]">05</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">Five barriers to account access</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">To enter your user account we have the following controls: password, 2FA, authorized IP, connection/operation analysis with AI, and biometric access.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-6"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px]">06</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">Customer protection</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">We perform AML analysis, 3DS card payment checks, work with encrypted data, and have outstanding customer support valued by users.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14 border-t border-border-low"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8"><p class="text-content-high typo-title-s shrink-0">Bit2Me in the media</p><div class="w-full"><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8"><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Forbes" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-20 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/media/media-forbes@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Bloomberg" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-20 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/media/media-bloomberg@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="CoinDesk" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-20 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/media/media-coindesk@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="NBC" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-20 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/media/media-nbc@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="TechCrunch" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-20 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/media/media-tc@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Yahoo Finance" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-20 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/media/media-yahoo-finance@2x.webp"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center"><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><img alt="Bit2Me Tax" loading="lazy" width="550" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-b2m-m w-full h-auto object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Ftax%2Fbit2me-tax%402x.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Ftax%2Fbit2me-tax%402x.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Ftax%2Fbit2me-tax%402x.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85"/></div><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><span class="typo-caption text-content-mid mb-1 block">Bit2Me Tax</span><h2 class="typo-h2 text-content-high mb-6">Everything you need for your tax return</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-8"><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-b2m-primary rounded-full shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><span class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">Integrated tool for free fiscal report export with one click</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-b2m-primary rounded-full shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><span class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">Tax advisors at your disposal</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-b2m-primary rounded-full shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><span class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">Educational tutorials on taxation and cryptocurrencies</span></li></ul><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-transparent text-content-primary hover:bg-surface-action-low hover:text-b2m-primary-hover px-3 h-9 text-high-xs gap-1 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer" href="/suite/tax">Learn more about Tax<span class="inline-flex items-center leading-none interactive-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><i class="b2m-icon-arrow-right b2m-icon-glyph icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="text-center mb-12"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Complete</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high typo-h2">360º Platform</h2></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="b2m-component component-banner group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-m bg-surface-low min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[340px]"><div class="relative z-10 p-8 md:py-12 sm:max-w-[65%]"><h3 class="mb-2 typo-h2 text-content-high">More than 30 products specialised in cryptocurrencies</h3><p class="typo-title mb-2 text-content-high">An account with Bit2Me, the crypto universe in your hands</p><p class="typo-body mb-6 text-content-mid">We offer a wide range of functionalities and products, constantly innovating and adapting to the ever-changing market trends.</p></div><div class="hidden sm:block absolute z-0 pointer-events-none bottom-0 w-[55%] aspect-square right-0"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/service-360/complete-platform@2x.webp"/></div><div class="sm:hidden relative h-64 w-full pointer-events-none shrink-0 overflow-hidden"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/service-360/complete-platform@2x.webp"/></div></div><div class="b2m-component component-banner group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-m bg-surface-low min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[340px]"><div class="relative z-10 p-8 md:py-12 sm:max-w-[65%]"><h3 class="mb-2 typo-h2 text-content-high">For individuals, companies, institutions, and governments</h3><p class="typo-title mb-2 text-content-high">We serve all types of clients</p><p class="typo-body mb-6 text-content-mid">Unlike the majority of platforms, at Bit2Me we have made efforts to cover the widest range of clients.</p></div><div class="hidden sm:block absolute z-0 pointer-events-none bottom-0 w-[55%] aspect-square right-0"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/service-360/user-types@2x.webp"/></div><div class="sm:hidden relative h-64 w-full pointer-events-none shrink-0 overflow-hidden"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/service-360/user-types@2x.webp"/></div></div><div class="b2m-component component-banner group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-m bg-surface-low min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[340px]"><div class="relative z-10 p-8 md:py-12 sm:max-w-[65%]"><h3 class="mb-2 typo-h2 text-content-high">More than 100 countries from all continents</h3><p class="typo-title mb-2 text-content-high">We operate globally</p><p class="typo-body mb-6 text-content-mid">Nearly 1,000,000 users operate daily on our platform, accessible from the web and app (Android and IOS).</p><span data-theme="light" class="contents"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-transparent text-content-primary hover:bg-surface-action-low hover:text-b2m-primary-hover px-4 py-3 text-high-s gap-2 min-h-spacing-b2m-12 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer" href="/go/www-security" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Download the APP: More than 100 countries from all continents">Download the APP<span class="inline-flex items-center leading-none interactive-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><i class="b2m-icon-arrow-right b2m-icon-glyph icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></a></span></div><div class="hidden sm:block absolute z-0 pointer-events-none bottom-0 w-[55%] aspect-square right-0"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/service-360/global@2x.webp"/></div><div class="sm:hidden relative h-64 w-full pointer-events-none shrink-0 overflow-hidden"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/service-360/global@2x.webp"/></div></div><div class="b2m-component component-banner group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-m bg-surface-low min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[340px]"><div class="relative z-10 p-8 md:py-12 sm:max-w-[65%]"><h3 class="mb-2 typo-h2 text-content-high">More than 300 cryptocurrencies available</h3><p class="typo-title mb-2 text-content-high">We list new cryptocurrencies every month</p><p class="typo-body mb-6 text-content-mid">We analyse user requests, and always implement them ensuring they meet minimum security standards.</p></div><div class="hidden sm:block absolute z-0 pointer-events-none bottom-0 w-[55%] aspect-square right-0"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/service-360/wide-crypto-provider@2x.webp"/></div><div class="sm:hidden relative h-64 w-full pointer-events-none shrink-0 overflow-hidden"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain object-right-bottom" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/service-360/wide-crypto-provider@2x.webp"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-12 md:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="text-center mb-16"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Principles</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high typo-h2">Our DNA, our principles</h2><p class="typo-body max-w-2xl text-content-mid mx-auto">We have designed our company following some fundamental pillars that protect our customers on a daily basis</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 mb-8"><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px] mb-4 md:mb-6">01</span><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">Security above all</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">We implement all existing and future measures to ensure your cryptocurrencies are as secure as possible and with the least possible friction in the user experience.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px] mb-4 md:mb-6">02</span><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">We are an open book</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">Transparency is our mantra. We have nothing to hide, neither in small print nor in large.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px] mb-4 md:mb-6">03</span><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">We learn from our mistakes</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">If we make a mistake, we acknowledge it, apologise, and learn from it. That&#x27;s how we&#x27;ve become experts!</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px] mb-4 md:mb-6">04</span><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">No chains</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">No commitment to stay, come and go as you please, because at Bit2Me the only chains are the blockchain ones. </p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px] mb-4 md:mb-6">05</span><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">The crypto ecosystem in your hands</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">We offer a wide variety of services, products, and above all, hundreds of cryptocurrencies available.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px] mb-4 md:mb-6">06</span><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">We don&#x27;t do borders</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">We provide access to all the places where we are allowed. We are currently available in over 150 countries around the world.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px] mb-4 md:mb-6">07</span><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">Innovation addicts</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">We are always up to date. If there&#x27;s something new in the world of cryptocurrencies, you can bet we have it.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px] mb-4 md:mb-6">08</span><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">We are obsessed with doing things right</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">We comply with all laws and regulations, even before they are enforced. We don&#x27;t cheat, because we believe in fair play.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 max-w-3xl"><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px] mb-4 md:mb-6">09</span><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">We believe in crypto knowledge as a fundamental right</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">That&#x27;s why we work daily to ensure our crypto academy is accessible, free, and of quality.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="text-content-mid typo-display shrink-0 w-[64px] mb-4 md:mb-6">10</span><h3 class="text-content-high typo-h3 mb-2">Always by your side</h3><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">We are with you at every step of your crypto journey. No matter where you are or what you need, we are here to help.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-14 md:py-16"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center"><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="550" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-b2m-m w-full h-auto object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcontact%2Fsupport-desktop-2x.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcontact%2Fsupport-desktop-2x.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fcontact%2Fsupport-desktop-2x.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85"/></div><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><div class="text-left mb-6"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">You will never be alone</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high">With Bit2Me, you always have someone by your side to help you</h2></div><div class="space-y-4 mb-8"><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">In the event of any incident, Bit2Me has specialised support in cryptocurrencies and the products we offer, providing fast and efficient support, responding to the needs and concerns of customers even by phone in their language (for the moment we support up to 7 languages and 15 countries).</p><p class="text-content-mid typo-body-s">Telephone support that accompanies you step by step through doubts and incidents is something that makes us practically unique in a direct way.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-surface-low text-content-high hover:bg-b2m-surface-hover px-3 h-9 text-high-xs gap-1 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer" href="/support">Contact us</a><a target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-content-primary typo-title interactive-link interactive-press hover:text-b2m-primary-hover" href="https://wa.me/34900844847">Write to us on Whatsapp<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-14 md:py-16"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="text-center mb-8 md:mb-10"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Easy</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high">Simple and intuitive platform</h2></div><div class="grid gap-5 md:gap-6 grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4"><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-check-circle b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Intuitive interface</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">Interface designed for comfort and user experience. We work daily with real users for continuous improvement.</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-user b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Simplified registration</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">The user can be operating on the platform in less than 3 minutes</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-support b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Real-time assistance</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">The platform offers integrated support modules and real-time assistance to resolve any questions or issues.</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-settings b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Advanced features made simple</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">We simplify highly complex functions and reduce them to a single click and user-friendly language.</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-swap b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Flexibility in deposits and withdrawals</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">Add and withdraw funds via blockchain, instant bank transfer at no cost, credit/debit card, or Google/Apple Pay.</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-tag b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Low commissions</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">We have highly liquid markets, for example BTC/EUR, with fees as low as 0% for makers and 0.10% for takers.</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-language b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Multi-language</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">We support 7 languages: Spanish, English, Portuguese, Italian, German, French, and Polish. And we are working to expand to 15 languages.</div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full rounded-b2m-m bg-white p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full w-12 h-12 icon-container-md bg-info-bg text-content-primary mb-4"><i class="b2m-icon-academy b2m-icon-glyph text-content-primary icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Tutorials, training, and access to experts</h3><div class="typo-body text-content-mid">We offer free training through the largest crypto Academy, as well as live AMA sessions with experts, who can also be hired privately.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white py-14 md:py-16"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16 items-center"><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><div><div class="text-left mb-6 md:mb-8"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Security barriers</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high">Multiple perimeter control</h2></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex gap-4 items-start"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-b2m-primary text-white typo-title-s">1</div><div class="pt-1"><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Username and password</h3></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 items-start"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-b2m-primary text-white typo-title-s">2</div><div class="pt-1"><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Two-factor authentication</h3></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 items-start"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-b2m-primary text-white typo-title-s">3</div><div class="pt-1"><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">Authorized device</h3></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 items-start"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-b2m-primary text-white typo-title-s">4</div><div class="pt-1"><h3 class="typo-title mb-1 text-content-high">AI-based behavioural analysis</h3></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fperimetral-control%2Fwaves-image%402x.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fperimetral-control%2Fwaves-image%402x.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=85 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Fperimetral-control%2Fwaves-image%402x.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=85"/></div></div></div></div><section class="bg-white py-14 md:py-16" id="security-milestones" aria-labelledby="security-milestones-title"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="text-center mb-12"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">What&#x27;s new in Bit2Me</span><h2 id="security-milestones-title" class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high">Some of the most important news</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3"><a class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low rounded-b2m-m overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-border-mid transition-interactive interactive-card-hover interactive-elevate" id="bi-www-security-page-en-milestones-mica-license" aria-label="Bit2Me and MiCA: more trust, more services and a Europe within your reach" title="Bit2Me and MiCA: more trust, more services and a Europe within your reach" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/bit2me-y-mica-mas-confianza-mas-servicios-y-una-europa-a-tu-alcance/"><div class="relative w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-surface-low aspect-[16/10]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/main/b2b/news/bit2me-mica.webp"/></div><div class="flex min-h-[140px] flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5"><h3 class="typo-title line-clamp-3 transition-colors group-hover:text-content-primary text-content-high">Bit2Me and MiCA: more trust, more services and a Europe within your reach</h3><p class="typo-body-s line-clamp-3 text-content-mid">At Bit2Me, we have just taken a huge step on our path as we have received official authorisation from the CNMV to operate under the European MiCA Regulation.</p></div></a><a class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low rounded-b2m-m overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-border-mid transition-interactive interactive-card-hover interactive-elevate" id="bi-www-security-page-en-milestones-psd2-bde" aria-label="Bit2Me authorised as a payment institution by Banco de España (PSD2)" title="Bit2Me authorised as a payment institution by Banco de España (PSD2)" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://app.bde.es/rbe_spa/detalle/3604"><div class="relative w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-surface-low aspect-[16/10]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/main/b2b/news/bank-of-spain.webp"/></div><div class="flex min-h-[140px] flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5"><h3 class="typo-title line-clamp-3 transition-colors group-hover:text-content-primary text-content-high">Bit2Me authorised as a payment institution by Banco de España (PSD2)</h3><p class="typo-body-s line-clamp-3 text-content-mid">BITCOINFORME, S.L. is registered as a payment institution with Banco de España (code 6947), listed on 15/07/2026, for transfer execution. It complements the MiCA (CNMV) framework.</p></div></a><a class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low rounded-b2m-m overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-border-mid transition-interactive interactive-card-hover interactive-elevate" id="bi-www-security-page-en-milestones-iso-27701" aria-label="Bit2Me obtains ISO 27701 privacy certification" title="Bit2Me obtains ISO 27701 privacy certification" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/bit2me-refuerza-su-liderazgo-en-privacidad-con-la-obtencion-de-la-certificacion-iso-27701/"><div class="relative w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-surface-low aspect-[16/10]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" src="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/Joao-EQA-ISO.jpg"/></div><div class="flex min-h-[140px] flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5"><h3 class="typo-title line-clamp-3 transition-colors group-hover:text-content-primary text-content-high">Bit2Me obtains ISO 27701 privacy certification</h3><p class="typo-body-s line-clamp-3 text-content-mid">Bit2Me strengthens its data-protection leadership with ISO 27701, adding to its compliance and security framework for business clients.</p></div></a><a class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low rounded-b2m-m overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-border-mid transition-interactive interactive-card-hover interactive-elevate" id="bi-www-security-page-en-milestones-cecabank-custody" aria-label="Cecabank launches crypto custody with Bit2Me" title="Cecabank launches crypto custody with Bit2Me" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/cecabank-arranca-con-su-primer-cliente-el-servicio-de-custodia-de-criptoactivos-en-colaboracion-con-bit2me/"><div class="relative w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-surface-low aspect-[16/10]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" src="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/blog-NDP-Jun26.jpg"/></div><div class="flex min-h-[140px] flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5"><h3 class="typo-title line-clamp-3 transition-colors group-hover:text-content-primary text-content-high">Cecabank launches crypto custody with Bit2Me</h3><p class="typo-body-s line-clamp-3 text-content-mid">Cecabank activates its custody platform for financial institutions, with Renta 4 Banco as the first client, supported by Bit2Me.</p></div></a><a class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low rounded-b2m-m overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-border-mid transition-interactive interactive-card-hover interactive-elevate" id="bi-www-security-page-en-milestones-bankinter" aria-label="The Spanish bank Bankinter joins BBVA and Tether with participation in Bit2Me" title="The Spanish bank Bankinter joins BBVA and Tether with participation in Bit2Me" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.coindesk.com/es/business/2026/01/14/spanish-bank-bankinter-joins-bbva-and-tether-with-stake-in-crypto-exchange-bit2me"><div class="relative w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-surface-low aspect-[16/10]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/main/b2b/news/bit2me-cointelegraph.webp"/></div><div class="flex min-h-[140px] flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5"><h3 class="typo-title line-clamp-3 transition-colors group-hover:text-content-primary text-content-high">The Spanish bank Bankinter joins BBVA and Tether with participation in Bit2Me</h3><p class="typo-body-s line-clamp-3 text-content-mid">The investment strengthens the capital structure of Bit2Me and supports its regulatory ambitions in Europe and Latin America.</p></div></a><a class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low rounded-b2m-m overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-border-mid transition-interactive interactive-card-hover interactive-elevate" id="bi-www-security-page-en-milestones-tether-round" aria-label="Tether leads a €30m investment round in Bit2Me" title="Tether leads a €30m investment round in Bit2Me" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/tether-adquiere-una-participacion-minoritaria-de-bit2me-y-lidera-una-ronda-de-inversion-de-30-millones-de-euros/"><div class="relative w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-surface-low aspect-[16/10]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" src="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/08/Blog-inapp_Bit2MexTether_Bit2Me.png"/></div><div class="flex min-h-[140px] flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5"><h3 class="typo-title line-clamp-3 transition-colors group-hover:text-content-primary text-content-high">Tether leads a €30m investment round in Bit2Me</h3><p class="typo-body-s line-clamp-3 text-content-mid">Tether acquires a minority stake and leads the round, strengthening Bit2Me’s capital and international outlook.</p></div></a><a class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low rounded-b2m-m overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-border-mid transition-interactive interactive-card-hover interactive-elevate" id="bi-www-security-page-en-milestones-results-2025" aria-label="Bit2Me closed 2025 with €5.346bn volume and eyes European expansion" title="Bit2Me closed 2025 with €5.346bn volume and eyes European expansion" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/bit2me-cerro-2025-con-5-346-millones-de-euros-en-volumen-de-negocio-221-millones-de-ingresos-y-13-millones-de-clientes-y-afronta-en-2026-su-expansion-por-europa/"><div class="relative w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-surface-low aspect-[16/10]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" src="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/Leif-y-Andrei-01_2026-reducida-scaled.jpg"/></div><div class="flex min-h-[140px] flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5"><h3 class="typo-title line-clamp-3 transition-colors group-hover:text-content-primary text-content-high">Bit2Me closed 2025 with €5.346bn volume and eyes European expansion</h3><p class="typo-body-s line-clamp-3 text-content-mid">The company reported €22.1m in revenue and 1.3m clients, and is reinforcing its European roadmap in 2026.</p></div></a><a class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low rounded-b2m-m overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-border-mid transition-interactive interactive-card-hover interactive-elevate" id="bi-www-security-page-en-milestones-tu-wallet" aria-label="TU Wallet is born, the new app from Telefónica that comes hand in hand with Bit2Me" title="TU Wallet is born, the new app from Telefónica that comes hand in hand with Bit2Me" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/tu-wallet-telefonica-api-bit2me/"><div class="relative w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-surface-low aspect-[16/10]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" src="/assets/img/main/home/news/bit2me-telefonica.webp"/></div><div class="flex min-h-[140px] flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5"><h3 class="typo-title line-clamp-3 transition-colors group-hover:text-content-primary text-content-high">TU Wallet is born, the new app from Telefónica that comes hand in hand with Bit2Me</h3><p class="typo-body-s line-clamp-3 text-content-mid">Bit2Me, the first registered cryptocurrency platform at the Bank of Spain, has been the company chosen by Telefónica to fully operate TU Wallet, an app for managing cryptoassets, where Bit2Me offers the buying and selling of cryptocurrencies.</p></div></a><a class="bg-surface-raised shadow-b2m-card border border-border-low rounded-b2m-m overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-border-mid transition-interactive interactive-card-hover interactive-elevate" id="bi-www-security-page-en-milestones-stocks-cnmv" aria-label="Bit2Me Stocks registers with the CNMV as a tied agent" title="Bit2Me Stocks registers with the CNMV as a tied agent" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/bit2me-inscribe-bit2me-stocks-en-la-cnmv-como-agente-vinculado-a-una-agencia-de-valores-y-lanzara-bit2me-invest-una-solucion-para-comprar-fondos-de-inversion-acciones-y-etfs/"><div class="relative w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-surface-low aspect-[16/10]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" src="https://blog.bit2me.com/es/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/blog-NDP-Abr26.jpg"/></div><div class="flex min-h-[140px] flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5"><h3 class="typo-title line-clamp-3 transition-colors group-hover:text-content-primary text-content-high">Bit2Me Stocks registers with the CNMV as a tied agent</h3><p class="typo-body-s line-clamp-3 text-content-mid">Bit2Me advances toward Bit2Me Invest: a solution to buy funds, stocks and ETFs, with Bit2Me Stocks registered with the CNMV as a tied agent of an investment firm.</p></div></a></div><div class="mt-10 flex justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-surface-low text-content-high hover:bg-b2m-surface-hover px-4 py-3 text-high-s gap-2 min-h-spacing-b2m-12 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer min-h-[44px]" href="https://blog.bit2me.com/en/sections/press-release" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="See all press releases — Some of the most important news">See all press releases</a></div></div></section><div class="bg-white py-14 md:py-16"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-[1200px]"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-12"><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><div class="text-left mb-6"><span class="typo-overline mb-1 block text-content-mid">Transparency of partners</span><h2 class="mb-4 typo-h2 text-content-high">Renowned management team and investors</h2></div><div class="space-y-4 mb-8"><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">All Bit2Me partners are known and can be publicly analyzed.</p><p class="text-content-mid typo-body">We have Leif Ferreira as founder and CEO, along with Andrei Manuel as the main partners of the company. And as principal investors, well-known companies such as Telefónica, Inveready, and Investcorp.</p></div><div class="w-full mb-8"><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8"><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Telefónica" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/transparency/telefonica@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Investcorp" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/transparency/investcorp@2x.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img alt="Inveready" loading="lazy" width="128" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/img/security/transparency/inveready@2x.webp"/></div></div></div></div><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-interactive active:scale-[0.98] select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] bg-transparent text-content-primary hover:bg-surface-action-low hover:text-b2m-primary-hover px-3 h-9 text-high-xs gap-1 rounded-b2m-s cursor-pointer" aria-label="More about us — Bit2Me" href="/about">More about us<span class="inline-flex items-center leading-none interactive-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><i class="b2m-icon-arrow-right b2m-icon-glyph icon-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></a></div><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><img alt="Leif Ferreira and Andrei Manuel, co-founders of Bit2Me" loading="lazy" width="600" height="450" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-b2m-m object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Ftransparency%2Fleif-ferreira-andrei-manuel%402x.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fsecurity%2Ftransparency%2Fleif-ferreira-andrei-manuel%402x.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 