16" id="press-highlights" aria-labelledby="press-highlights-title"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1600px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[280px_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:items-start xl:grid-cols-[320px_minmax(0,1fr)] xl:gap-14"><div class="lg:pt-2"><p class="mb-3 typo-overline text-white/70">Press releases</p><h2 id="press-highlights-title" class="mb-4 max-w-[21rem] typo-h2 text-white">What Bit2Me is building</h2><p class="mb-6 max-w-[22rem] typo-body text-white/70">Official announcements on product, regulation and the Bit2Me ecosystem.</p><a href="https://blog.bit2me.com/en/sections/press-release" id="bi-www-security-page-en-press-highlights-blog-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 typo-title-s text-white transition-interactive hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4">View all press releases<i class="b2m-icon-external-link b2m-icon-glyph icon-s" aria-hidden="true"></i></a><div class="flex items-center gap-3" aria-hidden="false"><button type="button" disabled="" aria-label="Previous" aria-controls="press-highlights-carousel-viewport" class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-interactive interactive-press focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 border-white/15 bg-b2m-footer-surface text-white hover:bg-b2m-primary hover:text-white"><i class="b2m-icon-chevron-left b2m-icon-glyph icon-s" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><button type="button" disabled="" aria-label="Next" aria-controls="press-highlights-carousel-viewport" class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-interactive interactive-press focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-b2m-primary focus-visible:outline-offset-[2px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 border-white/15 bg-b2m-footer-surface text-white hover:bg-b2m-primary hover:text-white"><i class="b2m-icon-chevron-right b2m-icon-glyph icon-s" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div id="press-highlights-carousel-viewport" class="overflow-hidden lg:pr-[8vw]" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Latest Bit2Me press releases" aria-labelledby="press-highlights-title" tabindex="0"><div class="flex -ml-5"><article id="press-highlights-carousel-slide-0" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 basis-[86%] pl-5 sm:basis-[68%] md:basis-[46%] lg:basis-[31%] xl:basis-[28%]" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Izertis adds Bit2Me’s services to bring crypto assets closer to businesses (1/11)"><a href="https://blog.bit2me.com/en/izertis-bit2mes-services-crypto-assets/" id="bi-www-security-page-en-https-blog-bit2me-com-en-p-8478-post-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group flex flex-col text-white no-underline hover:text-white h-full"><div class="relative mb-4 aspect-[16/10] w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-l bg-b2m-footer-surface"><img alt="Izertis adds Bit2Me’s services to bring crypto assets closer to businesses" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/09/izertisxbit2me.jpeg"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col"><div class="mb-3 flex min-h-5 items-center gap-2"><span class="typo-overline text-white/60">Bit2Me</span><time dateTime="2026-09-21T20:13:02+00:00" class="typo-caption text-white/50">2026-09-21</time></div><h3 class="mb-3 typo-title text-white line-clamp-3">Izertis adds Bit2Me’s services to bring crypto assets closer to businesses</h3><p class="mb-5 typo-body-s text-white/70 line-clamp-3">The agreement allows Izertis&#x27;s clients to incorporate stablecoin payments, crypto asset custody and new business avenues, regardless of their sector or size. Izertis contributes business know-how and</p><span class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 typo-title-s text-white transition-interactive group-hover:underline group-hover:underline-offset-4">Read article<i class="b2m-icon-arrow-right b2m-icon-glyph icon-s transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></div></a></article><article id="press-highlights-carousel-slide-1" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 basis-[86%] pl-5 sm:basis-[68%] md:basis-[46%] lg:basis-[31%] xl:basis-[28%]" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Bit2Me announces Bit2Shield, a blockchain custody and investigation agency for public institutions and financial entities (2/11)"><a href="https://blog.bit2me.com/en/bit2me-announces-bit2shield-a-blockchain-custody-and-investigation-agency-for-public-institutions-and-financial-entities/" id="bi-www-security-page-en-https-blog-bit2me-com-en-p-8472-post-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group flex flex-col text-white no-underline hover:text-white h-full"><div class="relative mb-4 aspect-[16/10] w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-l bg-b2m-footer-surface"><img alt="Bit2Me announces Bit2Shield, a blockchain custody and investigation agency for public institutions and financial entities" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/09/lanzamiento-bit2shield.jpg"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col"><div class="mb-3 flex min-h-5 items-center gap-2"><span class="typo-overline text-white/60">Bit2Shield</span><time dateTime="2026-09-08T13:46:18+00:00" class="typo-caption text-white/50">2026-09-08</time></div><h3 class="mb-3 typo-title text-white line-clamp-3">Bit2Me announces Bit2Shield, a blockchain custody and investigation agency for public institutions and financial entities</h3><p class="mb-5 typo-body-s text-white/70 line-clamp-3">Bit2Shield is a new company within the Bit2Me Group, with its own legal personality, dedicated to technical-legal services on digital assets for the public sector and financial institutions. Its B2G a</p><span class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 typo-title-s text-white transition-interactive group-hover:underline group-hover:underline-offset-4">Read article<i class="b2m-icon-arrow-right b2m-icon-glyph icon-s transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></div></a></article><article id="press-highlights-carousel-slide-2" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 basis-[86%] pl-5 sm:basis-[68%] md:basis-[46%] lg:basis-[31%] xl:basis-[28%]" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Bit2Me reinforces its leadership in privacy by obtaining the ISO 27701 certification (3/11)"><a href="https://blog.bit2me.com/en/bit2me-reinforces-its-leadership-in-privacy-by-obtaining-the-iso-27701-certification/" id="bi-www-security-page-en-https-blog-bit2me-com-en-p-8446-post-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group flex flex-col text-white no-underline hover:text-white h-full"><div class="relative mb-4 aspect-[16/10] w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-b2m-l bg-b2m-footer-surface"><img alt="Bit2Me reinforces its leadership in privacy by obtaining the ISO 27701 certification" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/07/Joao-EQA-ISO.jpg"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col"><div class="mb-3 flex min-h-5 items-center gap-2"><span class="typo-overline text-white/60">Highlights</span><time dateTime="2026-01-29T11:06:54+00:00" class="typo-caption text-white/50