bit2mes-services-crypto-assets/\",\"title\":\"Izertis adds Bit2Me’s services to bring crypto assets closer to businesses\",\"date_published\":\"2026-09-21T20:13:02+00:00\",\"summary\":\"The agreement allows Izertis's clients to incorporate stablecoin payments, crypto asset custody and new business avenues, regardless of their sector or size. Izertis contributes business know-how and\",\"content_text\":\"The agreement allows Izertis's clients to incorporate stablecoin payments, crypto asset custody and new business avenues, regardless of their sector or size. Izertis contributes business know-how and\",\"image\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/09/izertisxbit2me.jpeg\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-09-21T20:13:02+00:00\",\"tags\":[\"Bit2Me\",\"Izertis\",\"Highlights\",\"Press Release\"]},{\"id\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/?p=8472\",\"url\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/bit2me-announces-bit2shield-a-blockchain-custody-and-investigation-agency-for-public-institutions-and-financial-entities/\",\"title\":\"Bit2Me announces Bit2Shield, a blockchain custody and investigation agency for public institutions and financial entities\",\"date_published\":\"2026-09-08T13:46:18+00:00\",\"summary\":\"Bit2Shield is a new company within the Bit2Me Group, with its own legal personality, dedicated to technical-legal services on digital assets for the public sector and financial institutions. Its B2G a\",\"content_text\":\"Bit2Shield is a new company within the Bit2Me Group, with its own legal personality, dedicated to technical-legal services on digital assets for the public sector and financial institutions. Its B2G a\",\"image\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/09/lanzamiento-bit2shield.jpg\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-09-08T13:52:32+00:00\",\"tags\":[\"Bit2Shield\",\"Highlights\",\"Press Release\"]},{\"id\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/?p=8446\",\"url\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/bit2me-reinforces-its-leadership-in-privacy-by-obtaining-the-iso-27701-certification/\",\"title\":\"Bit2Me reinforces its leadership in privacy by obtaining the ISO 27701 certification\",\"date_published\":\"2026-01-29T11:06:54+00:00\",\"summary\":\"Madrid, January 29, 2026. – Bit2Me receives the ISO 27701 standard from EQA, an independent reference entity in certification, coinciding with Data Protection Day. This international distinction endor\",\"content_text\":\"Madrid, January 29, 2026. – Bit2Me receives the ISO 27701 standard from EQA, an independent reference entity in certification, coinciding with Data Protection Day. This international distinction endor\",\"image\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/07/Joao-EQA-ISO.jpg\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-07-14T11:11:02+00:00\",\"tags\":[\"Highlights\",\"Press Release\"]},{\"id\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/?p=8449\",\"url\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/bankinter-joins-bit2mes-capital-structure-following-e30-million-funding-round/\",\"title\":\"Bankinter Joins Bit2Me’s Capital Structure Following €30 Million Funding Round\",\"date_published\":\"2026-01-14T07:18:00+00:00\",\"summary\":\"Through this agreement, both entities will explore technological synergies and knowledge-sharing opportunities. The bank reinforces its commitment to technological innovation through its venture capit\",\"content_text\":\"Through this agreement, both entities will explore technological synergies and knowledge-sharing opportunities. The bank reinforces its commitment to technological innovation through its venture capit\",\"image\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/07/blog-NDP-Ene26-EN.jpg\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-07-15T07:21:26+00:00\",\"tags\":[\"Highlights\",\"Press Release\"]},{\"id\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/?p=7872\",\"url\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/bit2me-and-dekalabs-strengthen-their-commitment-to-technological-innovation-in-the-sports-industry/\",\"title\":\"Bit2Me and Dekalabs Strengthen Their Commitment to Technological Innovation in the Sports Industry\",\"date_published\":\"2025-09-03T07:11:31+00:00\",\"summary\":\"[This communication includes important legal disclaimers about crypto assets at the end of the document] Technology consultancy Dekalabs, part of the Bit2Me ecosystem, has launched a new website and e\",\"content_text\":\"[This communication includes important legal disclaimers about crypto assets at the end of the document] Technology consultancy Dekalabs, part of the Bit2Me ecosystem, has launched a new website and e\",\"image\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/08/NdP_Bit2MexDekalabs_Bit2Me.png\",\"date_modified\":\"2025-09-03T07:11:31+00:00\",\"tags\":[\"Highlights\",\"Press Release\"]},{\"id\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/?p=7897\",\"url\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/internxt-partners-with-bit2me-to-accept-payments-and-build-a-bitcoin-reserve/\",\"title\":\"Internxt partners with Bit2Me to accept payments and build a Bitcoin reserve\",\"date_published\":\"2025-08-27T07:09:20+00:00\",\"summary\":\"Internxt will allow its customers to pay with Bitcoin and other digital assets, aligning with the growing demand for privacy and digital sovereignty.  Digital asset payments will be stored with Bit2Me\",\"content_text\":\"Internxt will allow its customers to pay with Bitcoin and other digital assets, aligning with the growing demand for privacy and digital sovereignty. Digital asset payments will be stored with Bit2Me\",\"image\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/08/NdP_Bit2MexInternxt_Bit2Me.png\",\"date_modified\":\"2025-08-27T07:09:20+00:00\",\"tags\":[\"Highlights\",\"Press Release\"]},{\"id\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/?p=7838\",\"url\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/tether-acquires-minority-stake-in-bit2me-and-leads-e30-million-investment-round/\",\"title\":\"Tether Acquires Minority Stake in Bit2Me and Leads €30 Million Investment Round\",\"date_published\":\"2025-08-07T13:11:25+00:00\",\"summary\":\"Tether Ventures, the independent investment arm of Tether, the largest company in the digital asset industry and issuer of the world’s most capitalized stablecoin —USDT—has acquired a minority stake\",\"content_text\":\"Tether Ventures, the independent investment arm of Tether, the largest company in the digital asset industry and issuer of the world’s most capitalized stablecoin —USDT—has acquired a minority stake\",\"image\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/08/Blog-inapp_Bit2MexTether_Bit2Me.png\",\"date_modified\":\"2025-08-07T13:28:53+00:00\",\"tags\":[\"Highlights\",\"Only for app eng\",\"Press Release\"]},{\"id\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/?p=7657\",\"url\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/bit2me-launches-bit2me-travel-luxury-hotel-discounts-with-crypto-payments/\",\"title\":\"Bit2Me Launches Bit2Me Travel: Luxury Hotel Discounts with Crypto Payments\",\"date_published\":\"2025-05-21T08:11:07+00:00\",\"summary\":\"Bit2Me has launched Bit2Me Travel, a new service within the Bit2Me Life ecosystem that allows users to book luxury hotels with exclusive discounts compared to traditional booking platforms. Users can\",\"content_text\":\"Bit2Me has launched Bit2Me Travel, a new service within the Bit2Me Life ecosystem that allows users to book luxury hotels with exclusive discounts compared to traditional booking platforms. Users can\",\"image\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/05/Blog-inapp_Bit2Me-Life_Travel_EN.png\",\"date_modified\":\"2025-05-21T08:12:55+00:00\",\"tags\":[\"Highlights\",\"Press Release\"]},{\"id\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/?p=7647\",\"url\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/bit2me-joins-wydens-institutional-liquidity-network-further-expanding-connectivity-to-regulated-markets/\",\"title\":\"Bit2Me Joins Wyden’s Institutional Liquidity Network, Further Expanding Connectivity to Regulated Markets\",\"date_published\":\"2025-05-15T10:55:06+00:00\",\"summary\":\"Wyden, the leading provider of institutional digital asset trading infrastructure, today announced a new integration with Bit2Me, a prominent European digital asset trading venue with triple complianc\",\"content_text\":\"Wyden, the leading provider of institutional digital asset trading infrastructure, today announced a new integration with Bit2Me, a prominent European digital asset trading venue with triple complianc\",\"image\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/05/Blog-Partnership-Wyden-Bit2Me-EN.png\",\"date_modified\":\"2025-05-15T10:55:06+00:00\",\"tags\":[\"Highlights\",\"Press Release\"]},{\"id\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/?p=7635\",\"url\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/bit2me-sponsor-madrid-economic-forum-2025/\",\"title\":\"Bit2Me, Sponsor of the Madrid Economic Forum 2025, Will Celebrate Its 10th Anniversary in Front of Over 10,000 Attendees in Madrid\",\"date_published\":\"2025-05-14T09:18:47+00:00\",\"summary\":\"Bit2Me will be the official sponsor of the Madrid Economic Forum 2025, which will take place on June 7 and 8 at the Palacio de Vistalegre (Madrid), with more than 10,000 attendees expected. After two\",\"content_text\":\"Bit2Me will be the official sponsor of the Madrid Economic Forum 2025, which will take place on June 7 and 8 at the Palacio de Vistalegre (Madrid), with more than 10,000 attendees expected. After two\",\"image\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/05/Blog-Patrocinador_oficial_MEF2025-Bit2Me-EN.png\",\"date_modified\":\"2025-05-14T09:18:47+00:00\",\"tags\":[\"Highlights\",\"Press Release\"]}],\"sectionUrl\":\"https://blog.bit2me.com/en/sections/press-release\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"pageId\":\"security-page\",\"translations\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Press releases\",\"title\":\"What Bit2Me is building\",\"description\":\"Official announcements on product, regulation and the Bit2Me ecosystem.\",\"blogLink\":\"View all press releases\",\"readArticle\":\"Read article\",\"seeAllTitle\":\"View all articles\",\"seeAllDescription\":